---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Recording a Strength Workout — Chiron Support"
  description="Learn how to start, log, and finish a strength workout in Chiron, including checking off exercises and recording set-level reps and load."
>
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

      <nav class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">
        <a href="/support-center" class="hover:text-primary-600">Support Center</a>
        <span class="mx-2">›</span>
        <span class="text-gray-700">Recording a Strength Workout</span>
      </nav>

      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
        Recording a Strength Workout
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-12">
        Track your session in real time — check off exercises or log every set with reps and load.
      </p>

      <!-- Start the workout -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Start the workout</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Open your Schedule and tap today's strength workout. Tap <strong>Start Workout</strong> to begin.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
          A timer starts running from the moment you begin, recording your total session time.
        </p>

        <figure class="mt-6">
          <img
            src="/images/support-center/recording-a-strength-workout/chiron-strength-workout-active-recording.png"
            alt="The active recording screen in Chiron showing the session timer and exercise list for a strength workout"
            class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm mx-auto max-w-xs"
          />
          <figcaption class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 text-center">Active recording screen — timer running with exercise list</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>

      <!-- Record your exercises -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Record your exercises</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          For each exercise, you have two options:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 mb-6">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="text-primary-600 mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Check off</strong> — tap the checkbox to mark the exercise complete without logging set detail. Good for activation drills or bodyweight circuits.
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="text-primary-600 mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Log by set</strong> — tap into each set to record actual reps and load completed. Useful when your actual session differed from the plan — heavier top set, dropped reps on the last set, and so on.
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <figure class="mt-6">
          <img
            src="/images/support-center/recording-a-strength-workout/chiron-strength-workout-set-logging.png"
            alt="Set-level logging in Chiron showing reps and load fields with a check-off option per set"
            class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm mx-auto max-w-xs"
          />
          <figcaption class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 text-center">Set-level logging — enter actual reps and load, or check off the set</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>

      <!-- Finish the workout -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Finish the workout</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          When done, tap <strong>Finish Workout</strong>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
          Your completed session is saved with total duration, exercises completed, and any set-level data you recorded. It appears in your training history alongside your run and other activity data.
        </p>

        <figure class="mt-6">
          <img
            src="/images/support-center/recording-a-strength-workout/chiron-strength-workout-completed.png"
            alt="A completed strength workout shown on the Chiron schedule as done"
            class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm mx-auto max-w-xs"
          />
          <figcaption class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 text-center">Completed strength workout on your Schedule</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>

      <!-- Related articles -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related articles</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="text-primary-600 mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
            <a href="/support-center/strength-and-conditioning" class="text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-700 hover:underline">Strength &amp; Conditioning in Chiron</a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="text-primary-600 mr-2 mt-1">•</span>
            <a href="/support-center/scheduling-from%20workout-library" class="text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-700 hover:underline">Scheduling Workouts from the Workout Library</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Back / Contact -->
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-8 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Need More Help?</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
          Can't find what you're looking for? Get in touch with our team.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a
            href="/support-center"
            class="inline-block bg-white border border-primary-600 text-primary-600 px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-primary-50 transition-colors"
          >
            Back to Support Center
          </a>
          <a
            href="/support-center/contact"
            class="inline-block bg-primary-600 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-primary-700 transition-colors"
          >
            Contact Us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
